{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39984","headline":"贺清源太保王延[彬] 一 · 徐夤","name":"贺清源太保王延[彬] 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蘂珠宫里谪神仙，八载温陵万户闲。\n心地阔于云梦泽，官资高却太行山。\n姜牙兆寄熊罴内，陶侃文成掌握间。\n应笑清溪旧门吏，年年扶病掩柴关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39984.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39984","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}